A. Larger screens B. Unlimited power supply C. Flexibility and Ubiquity D. High-speed wired connection

Q22. In the CSS syntax `H1 { color : green }`, what is `H1` called?
A. Property B. Value C. Selector D. Declaration

Q23. Which command is used to compile a Java source file?
A. java B. javac C. compile D. run

Q24. Hard: In the context of Online Auctions, what happens when the time limit for a bid is reached?
A. The item is removed from the site. B. The item is transferred to the highest bidder. C. The auction restarts. D. The seller keeps the item.

Q25. What is the correct syntax to declare and create an integer array of size 5?
A. int marks = new int(5); B. int marks[] = new int[5]; C. int marks[5]; D. array int marks = new int[5];

Q26. When are 'Class Variables' (static variables) initialized?
A. Every time a new object is created. B. Only when the programmer explicitly initializes them. C. When the class is loaded, with default values. D. When the main method ends.

Q27. Which keyword is used to define a class in Java?
A. define B. struct C. class D. object

Q28. In the context of the notes, what is 'IDE'?
A. Internal Development Environment B. Integrated Development Environment C. Internet Development Engine D. Image Design Editor

Q29. What is the default value for the `method` attribute if it is not specified?
A. POST B. GET C. PUT D. SUBMIT

Q30. In a UML Class diagram, what does the top section contain?
