Q50. What does 'BOM' stand for?
A. Basic Object Model B. Browser Object Model C. Binary Object Method D. Business Operation Mode

Q51. Which HTTP method sends data as a block within the HTTP transaction, keeping it hidden from the URL?
A. GET B. POST C. OPEN D. SEND

